apps/3195840/extras/5d87b42c75570e198ba81046b1d8ec56.mp4?t=1759348315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Speed Precision Platformer</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, dash, and swing through the scenario with boldness and fun;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete deliveries as quickly as possible without damaging the cargo to satisfy your customers and optimize your earnings;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes 20 levels with dozens of challenges, platforms, and secret areas for you to explore and showcase your skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/f63d10c06d6c9e39f97f78edf0e7bbc5.poster.avif?t=1759348315\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/f63d10c06d6c9e39f97f78edf0e7bbc5.webm?t=1759348315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195840/extras/f63d10c06d6c9e39f97f78edf0e7bbc5.mp4?t=1759348315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decision-Making</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices in dialogues impact Gil's relationships with other characters and can affect gameplay;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter characters during levels: they may offer interesting side quests;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the money you earn strategically to pay the bills at the end of each day.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akama